They have a name.

47
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,240
They have members.

48
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,840
They meet regularly.

49
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:43,320
They start to share or discuss and prioritize different policies.

50
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:49,320
So what happens when this dissatisfied group forms within another group? What does it do to

51
