And I know we're gonna get to intro parties, but first, can we do political parties generally?

73
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:33,600
I know the Framers were very concerned about parties, George Washington especially, who

74
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:38,640
said they, quote, distract the public councils and enfeeble the public administration.

75
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:41,160
Yeah, nobody hated a party more than G-Dubs.

76
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:43,200
There ain't nobody like a George Washington party

