00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:45,480
because a George Washington party doesn't happen.

78
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:49,080
That guy would see a balloon on a mailbox

79
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,320
and he would tell his character,

80
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,800
ever like, just keep going.

81
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:54,760
And even though Washington wasn't a fan,

82
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:57,240
James Madison wrote on several occasions

83
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,360
that parties were inevitable

84
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:01,640
in our newly created governmental system.

85
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:04,520
Now I want to be careful today with the word factions

