00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,420
wanting us out of there?

296
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:07,920
Ron Paul, a Republican congressman from Texas who had formerly been affiliated with the Libertarian Party,

297
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:10,720
had also run for president in 2008.

298
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:13,920
He lost the GOP primary to Senator John McCain,

299
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:18,920
but Ron Paul's campaign sparked a group of disenchanted Republicans

